Package: bdhs
Title: Tools and Data for the Bangladesh Demographic and Health Survey
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Arman", "Hossen", , "hossena@miamioh.edu", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: A complete toolkit for every round of the Bangladesh Demographic
    and Health Survey (BDHS; 1993-94 to 2022) and related DHS Program surveys
    for Bangladesh. Ships official aggregate indicators from the DHS Program
    API, survey and dataset catalogues, cross-round codebooks, region
    crosswalks and subnational boundaries. For survey microdata, which the
    DHS Program licenses to registered users and does not allow to be
    redistributed, it imports a user's own downloads into a fast local store,
    harmonizes variables across rounds, builds correct complex survey designs,
    and computes indicators that are validated against official DHS
    estimates. See <https://dhsprogram.com>.
